1594.1,
1594.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that he saw whomever he was satisfied with among the people of knowledge say about a man who willed that his murderer be pardoned when he murdered him intentionally
1595.1,"Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Qatan ibn Wahb ibn Umayr ibn al-Ajda'."
